WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:01,710
Mother

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:04,010
Big brother was born from your belly

3
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:05,010
Since he can make money

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,690
Why don't you provide for your retirement?

5
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,410
His life was given by you

6
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:09,930
He wants to use that old lion agreement

7
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:10,850
Just leave you

8
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,530
He, Li Qingshan, doesn’t even think about it

9
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,690
You raised your eldest brother to adulthood

10
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,770
What's the result of giving him the skill of diving?

11
00:00:16,770 --> 00:00:17,730
He patted his butt

12
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:18,890
Go to Zhang Qiuyue’s natal family

13
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,740
When the cow sat on the horse and went to mother

14
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,580
You can swallow this breath

15
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,860
not that cheap

16
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,180
If Li Qingshan doesn’t support me in my old age,

17
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,780
I’m not done with him yet

18
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,420
At the very least, he should be allowed to

19
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,740
Give you fifty yuan pension

20
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,140
Now I'm going to find him for an explanation.

21
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,260
Mom, don’t be impatient

22
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,220
The eldest brother is still in the hospital bed now. Let’s wait and wait until he gets better.

23
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,020
It's not too late for us to go again after making money

24
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,020
The monk can run away, but the monk cannot run away.

25
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:42,580
Then wait until he gets better
